nestegg
------------------------------------------
nestegg is a WebM demuxer library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libnestegg-devel-0.1+git20260917-1bl1
  libnestegg0-0.1+git20260917-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mozilla/nestegg

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mozilla/nestegg.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack nestegg-0.1+git20260917-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./nestegg-0.1+git20260917-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/nestegg-0.1+git20260917-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/nestegg-0.1+git20260917-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnestegg0-0.1+git20260917-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnestegg-devel-0.1+git20260917-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(nestegg)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/nestegg.README
  /usr/share/doc/nestegg/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/nestegg/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/nestegg/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/nestegg/TODO
  /usr/share/doc/nestegg/doxygen-build.stamp

(libnestegg0)
  /usr/bin/cygnestegg-0.dll

(libnestegg-devel)
  /usr/include/nestegg/nestegg.h
  /usr/lib/libnestegg.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/nestegg.pc

